<title>USA: INDONESIA TELKOM AT 26-7/8 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>INDONESIA TELKOM AT 26-7/8 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at 26-7/8 in New York on Tuesday. It recorded the day's low of 26-7/8 and the day's high of 28.</p>
<p>Volume was 101,200 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 48,400. It previous close on Monday was 26-3/4. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
